# Dej

Read `AGENTS.md`, then the status at the top of `ARCHITECTURE.md`, before editing.

One milestone at a time. Stop for Dej’s approval. Milestone 1 is the orthographic room and the empty plan. Do not start wall dragging, furniture, rules, tracing, accounts, or a second room unless Dej asks.

The room object is the only state. Both views read it. The 3D camera stays orthographic. The dark desktop layout is the milestone 1 presentation. The warm full-page tracing sheet is a later design and is not implemented.

Do not invent a reference plan image. Do not claim research that is not written in `RESEARCH.md`. If a rule can be read two ways, ask Dej instead of choosing.
